{"parentUuid":"60de61f6-d27c-4a87-86df-878871b1528b","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"b2969dd6-8ba4-407d-b83e-bb26cef63937","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017w2hYFzTm98eeJBgMX8BDS","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /tmp/claude-501/body_specdrift.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"79945900-4aba-4cf9-8457-000f1b27eabe","timestamp":"2026-10-24T06:22:19.969Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"create","filePath":"/tmp/claude-501/body_specdrift.md","content":"Corrects the criteria in the five specs that no longer match the code. All 249 criteria were checked against the code, `docs/errors.md` and the 0.14 binary on scratch repos. Most held; 20 were wrong, incomplete or inconsistent.\n\nThe main cause is that `--package` on `add` and `matrix` and every package named in `callisto.toml` now require the ecosystem, so a bare name is E317 and the colon form is E316, where the specs still described bare names resolving or reporting E103.\n\nBy file:\n\n- `cli.json`: CLI-ADD-06 (E317, E316 instead of E103) and CLI-STATUS-03 (the `lastTag` key).\n- `matrix.json`: MX-DISC-11, MX-ERR-07 and MX-OUT-01 (qualified `--package`, `ecosystem/name` keys).\n- `workspace.json`: WS-ID-06 (E103 only for changeset entries in `version`, E317 and E102 for `--package`), WS-LOAD-02 (E313, E310 and E209 each have their own case), WS-CFG-04 (the prefix is mandatory), WS-ID-13 (adds `add` and `matrix`), WS-CFG-01 (a stray comma).\n- `versioning.json`: an empty changeset's bytes, `version` in pre mode still refreshes and stages, a Cargo `workspace = true` spec is rewritten in the root `[workspace.dependencies]`, a snapshot creates a missing `Cargo.lock` unstaged, the decision reason field names (`from`, `edgeKind`, `policyId`), the colon form in a changeset entry is E316, `pre.json` follows the changesets directory, and the two diagnostic names are written in their kebab-case wire form.\n- `release.json`: E169 also covers a snapshot version, the non-colour plan output, and the masking rule (8-character minimum, `CARGO_REGISTRIES_*_TOKEN`).\n\nNot checked, because they need a network, a real registry or a terminal: live npm, cargo, twine and `gh` behavior, the E320 version-commit walk, PyPI digest matching, and the interactive `add` wizard.\n\nSpecs only; no code changes. `just ci` passes.\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"a0e44df0-20b5-49d8-bb0c-25c405138041","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","branch":"docs/spec-drift","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":5,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"60de61f6-d27c-4a87-86df-878871b1528b","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"docs/spec-drift","slug":"lexical-jingling-puppy"}
