{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","id":"c16c51bb-72a2-4b75-bbb6-368466511348","timestamp":"2026-10-24T06:22:59.219Z","version":"2.1.304","querySource":"repl_main_thread:outputStyle:Concise","shapeHash":"761156c7f8e5f9beaaf03c55d45c00e6108ed5cc90a785040747ceaf99aae387","params":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"be5904ee-e517-48c2-8f23-fe4a27389cf4","keep":775,"tail":["f35c5889a07bd0bde934f35baeec11175c779a4cbcccc6570e894bbb4d528731","60664df83cfb403474903472d5844b5fb79e8271bd900ff946ddf3d23298c9b8","a819c2d8e979f439a5756bc04abf53b8e35e6d6777ea009c53a9449fc82eddde"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",777,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"474c003e209ad6c37e5b6432a38bb0dc1efcf0f843a114b78abb39e607217a87"}
{"parentUuid":"42dffb9f-5b03-4195-9b07-f3b7c9236895","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgLah6LbBmKRpwptnkjxm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The spec-drift pass is open as PR #346, with `just ci` passing and no changeset since it only touches docs.\n\nFour agents checked all 249 criteria against the code and the binary on scratch repos. About 20 were wrong or incomplete, and none cited a wrong error code or flag. Almost all the drift came from one change: a bare package name is now E317 and the colon form is E316, but the specs still described bare names resolving or reporting E103. The other fixes are:\n- **`status`:** the `lastTag` key was missing from the criterion.\n- **`workspace.json`:** the Cargo-workspace errors were folded into one code, but E313, E310 and E209 each apply in their own case.\n- **`version`:** it still refreshes and stages files in pre mode.\n- **Decision JSON:** the reason field names were wrong.\n- **`release.json`:** E169 also covers snapshot versions, and the masking rule has an 8-character minimum.\n\nWhat the agents could not check, and the PR doesn't claim to have checked: live npm, cargo, twine and `gh` behavior, the E320 version-commit walk, PyPI digest matching, and the interactive `add` wizard.\n\nThat leaves the decisions that are yours:\n- OIDC publishing for npm.\n- The private-root exclusion shape.\n- Accepting ADR 12.\n- Whether to prune the merged and gone local branches I mentioned earlier."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1475,"cache_read_input_tokens":486795,"output_tokens":463,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1475,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input