{"parentUuid":"f425bebb-c674-48bc-89dd-93af1da5605a","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"17e5e12e-3a39-45c3-bf9e-35421bdea6f0","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016BUdGSdBevMnwXXAYspQ3h","type":"tool_result","content":"callisto@0.14.2 | name= | draft=false\ncallisto@0.14.1 | name= | draft=false\ncallisto@0.14.0 | name= | draft=false\n- A release no longer waits past its confirmation window when a registry keeps asking to retry later. The run now gives up when the window ends, as the error already said.\n- The help for `add --package` and `matrix --package` now shows the `ecosystem/name` form they require, and the contributor and publishing guides match.\n1139:    use super::super::provider::{NotesFallback, ReleaseNotes};\n1593:            ReleaseNotes::Section(\"- fixed a bug\".to_owned())\n1611:                reason: NotesFallback::SectionEmpty","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"77c80d67-f9fb-4b25-be1a-172964b3397b","timestamp":"2026-10-24T06:26:46.784Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"callisto@0.14.2 | name= | draft=false\ncallisto@0.14.1 | name= | draft=false\ncallisto@0.14.0 | name= | draft=false\n- A release no longer waits past its confirmation window when a registry keeps asking to retry later. The run now gives up when the window ends, as the error already said.\n- The help for `add --package` and `matrix --package` now shows the `ecosystem/name` form they require, and the contributor and publishing guides match.\n1139:    use super::super::provider::{NotesFallback, ReleaseNotes};\n1593:            ReleaseNotes::Section(\"- fixed a bug\".to_owned())\n1611:                reason: NotesFallback::SectionEmpty","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true},"classifierBoundary":true,"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"e4fdcb92-b1dd-4405-b93c-acd657a44a62","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/call