 deps `package = \"x\"`, git/path deps, `publish = false`, npm `workspace:*`/`catalog:`/aliases `npm:`/overrides/peer/optional, PEP 440 specifiers with extras/markers, Poetry vs PEP 621 vs setuptools dynamic versions); (2) semver and PEP 440 handling: prerelease ordering, build metadata, 0.x rules, `none`/`patch` severities, pre mode enter/exit with dependents, snapshot versions; (3) cascade logic (crates/callisto-graph/src/cascade*): cycles, dev-dependency cycles, peer escalation, fixed/linked groups, a dependency range rewritten to one that excludes the new version, the 4n+1 bound; (4) changeset parsing (crates/callisto-model/src/format/changeset): frontmatter edge cases, unicode, huge files, duplicate entries, an entry naming the same package twice, summaries that could inject into generated markdown/PR bodies/workflow outputs; (5) changelog generation and idempotence (running `version` twice, partial failure leaving a half-written tree: is it atomic? see AGENTS.md invariants and callisto_model::atomic).\nFor each finding give: severity, exact file:line, a minimal input that triggers it, whether you REPRODUCED it (command + output) or only READ it, and a one-line fix direction. Rank by severity. Report at most the 12 most important findings; drop speculation you cannot tie to code. Also list 3-5 things done WELL. Be concise and precise."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"10d5f8d8-491b-4598-ad2c-cfbc872079f4","apiBlockIndex":4,"requestId":"req_011CgMQa7Lm22WxaxCCcJtMp","requestRef":"101d988e-7ad2-4706-8aa6-f8712495b10b","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"7d2a25db-e3ef-4503-9360-a871a0238581","timestamp":"2026-10-24T16:51:39.589Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","version":