{"parentUuid":"780c6b68-0a1f-48ab-8f49-e2b42679732c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgMRMaWQKe85UUAqJ9Uk6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The code confirms the security agent's finding 2: none of the failure reasons covers an unrelated changed path. The set is `DecisionNotWrittenByCommit`, `NoChangesetConsumed`, `ChangelogNotTouched`, `ManifestNotInDiff`, `ManifestVersionMismatch`, `UnclaimedVersionChange` and `ClaimedPackageNotObserved`. Failure/recovery and versioning are still outstanding; I'll hold the full ranked synthesis until they report.\n\nSo far, from the security lens:\n- **Confirmed in code:** the `execute` job leaves the push credential on disk (`persist-credentials: true`), the release-commit check doesn't limit which other files change, and default registries aren't bound in the intent.\n- **Read only:** the agent couldn't run anything, so none of its exploit paths is reproduced."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":925,"cache_read_input_tokens":562771,"output_tokens":290,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":925,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":290,"cache_read_input_tokens":562771,"cache_creation_input_tokens":925,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":925},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"66437a30-b2f6-401c-93ce-58cbb9f04323","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgMRMa95otML9TWB3ECqn","requestRef":"3d844dfe-58ee-439e-850f-630d9dcf3038","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant