{"parentUuid":"8e46dd17-e195-48d8-805e-18c8986b6da7","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"9060f1dc-711c-48e3-8f57-8ca746997cbc","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01P5XxjeKj1XTfV3xejQJBQK","type":"tool_result","content":"REDIRECT DETECTED: The URL redirects to a location that was not fetched automatically.\n\n    Original URL: https://pypi.org/help/#file-name-reuse\n    Redirect URL (from the server's Location header — server-supplied, not verified): https://docs.pypi.org/\n    Status: 301 Moved Permanently\n\n    To complete your request, I need to fetch content from the redirected URL. Please use WebFetch again with these parameters:\n    - url: \"https://docs.pypi.org/\"\n    - prompt: \"Rules on deleting files/releases/projects, whether a filename or version can be reused after deletion, and what yanking does (PEP 592).\""}]},"uuid":"ffd120a9-dfed-4ded-ab37-b5e0df645777","timestamp":"2026-10-24T17:44:53.264Z","toolUseResult":{"bytes":606,"code":301,"codeText":"Moved Permanently","result":"REDIRECT DETECTED: The URL redirects to a location that was not fetched automatically.\n\n    Original URL: https://pypi.org/help/#file-name-reuse\n    Redirect URL (from the server's Location header — server-supplied, not verified): https://docs.pypi.org/\n    Status: 301 Moved Permanently\n\n    To complete your request, I need to fetch content from the redirected URL. Please use WebFetch again with these parameters:\n    - url: \"https://docs.pypi.org/\"\n    - prompt: \"Rules on deleting files/releases/projects, whether a filename or version can be reused after deletion, and what yanking does (PEP 592).\"","durationMs":621,"url":"https://pypi.org/help/#file-name-reuse"},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"c6f9dc99-b041-4010-9c35-e9b9af08cba1","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","branch":"chore/release-target-facts","def