{"parentUuid":"eb1da4eb-003a-4aab-98de-79ee7118e5ed","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"output_style","style":"Concise","turnReminder":"Be concise: lead with the result, skip preamble and narration, keep only what the user needs."},"type":"attachment","uuid":"df185873-0300-443c-8fae-43aae5f38d11","timestamp":"2026-10-24T17:52:57.178Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nConcise output style is active. Be concise: lead with the result, skip preamble and narration, keep only what the user needs.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/init-defaults","slug":"lexical-jingling-puppy"}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","hash":"32557021c6b233bf5be0aa52cec4cd47e62b3653b79c3df340da2d5b5296f4cf","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Making the workflow default-on is risky since it resolves the `callisto@<version>` tag over the network, so an offline or dev-build `init --yes` would fail where it previously succeeded. I'll make a defaulted workflow degrade to a warning instead, reserving hard errors for when `--workflow` is explicitly passed.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016oZRnySuQ1UJWHnDKjT29w","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/crates/callisto-cli/src/commands/init.rs","old_string":"    let workflow = match shape.filter(|_| want_workflow) {\n        Some(shape) => {\n            scaffold::ensure_workflow_absent(&facts.root)?;\n            let branch = scaffold::default_branch(runner, &facts.root);\n            writeln!(human, \"  default branch: {} (from {})\", branch.name, branch.source)?;\n            let version = env!(\"CARGO_PKG_VERSION\");\n            let commit = scaffold::resolve_release_commit(runner, &facts.root, version)?;\n            let content = scaffold::render_workflow(&facts, shape, &branch.name, &commit, version);\n            Some((content, branch.name))\n        }\n        None => None,\n    };","new_str":"    // A workflow nobody asked for (the default) never fails `init`: if it cannot be built, say why and go on.\n    let asked_for_workflow = args.workflow || prompting;\n    let workflow = match shape.filter(|_| want_workflow) {\n        Some(shape) => match build_workflow(&facts, shape, runner, human) {\n            Ok(built) => Some(built),\n            Err(error) if !asked_for_workflow => {\n                let note = format!(\"Skipping the GitHub Actions workflow: {error}. Run `callisto init --workflow` to retry.\");\n                writeln!(human, \"{note}\")?;\n                diagnostics.push(callisto_model::Diagnostic {\n                    code: callisto_model::DiagnosticCode::WorkflowGenerationUnsupported,\n                    severity: callisto_model::DiagnosticSeverity::Warning,\n                    message: note,\n                    package: None,\n                    path: None,\n                    escalated_by: None,\n                    governed_by: None,\n                });\n                None\n            }\n            Err(error) => return Err(error),\n        },\n        None => None,\n    };"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011fKT3wdSbvGhDcjjtyGmQr","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/crates/callisto-cli/src/commands/init.rs","old_string":"/// Printed, and recorded as a warning diagnostic, when no `origin` remote is configured.","new_str":"/// The workflow text and the default branch it triggers on.\nfn build_workflow<R: CommandRunner>(\n    facts: &InitFacts,\n    shape: scaffold::WorkflowShape,\n    runner: &R,\n    human: &mut dyn Write,\n) -> Result<(String, String), CliError> {\n    scaffold::ensure_workflow_absent(&facts.root)?;\n    let branch = scaffold::default_branch(runner, &facts.root);\n    writeln!(human, \"  default branch: {} (from {})\", branch.name, branch.source)?;\n    let version = env!(\"CARGO_PKG_VERSION\");\n    let commit = scaffold::resolve_release_commit(runner, &facts.root, version)?;\n    let content = scaffold::render_workflow(facts, shape, &branch.name, &commit, version);\n    Ok((content, branch.name))\n}\n\n/// Printed, and recorded as a warning diagnostic, when no `origin` remote is configured."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01YGdczEyZgabJC9KPvQxKaM","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cargo build -p callisto-cli 2>&1 | tail -20","description":"Build after adding the defaulted-workflow fallback","timeout":600000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
