{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","hash":"f9a42a696af296e1c307209b1ea8f3964c794471e1c9c9c2890ba0b7301d3ef0","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013sJ1NMZsB2mUJyJW5iszmV","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/docs/specs/cli.json","old_string":"Interactive init asks only: versioning (independent or fixed); whether to ship","new_str":"Interactive init asks only: versioning (independent or fixed), only when the workspace has more than one package; whether to ship"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01WMJVmTmLu74KqoqT8ud22B","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/docs/specs/cli.json","old_string":"whether to generate a workflow (default no); and whether to write callisto.toml (default yes).","new_str":"whether to generate a workflow (default yes); and whether to write callisto.toml (default yes). Without --versioning, packages version independently."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014C2T2dBVDuw9fRFxP8zq8B","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/docs/specs/cli.json","old_string":"with --yes it exits 1 with `E241` naming each missing flag: --versioning always, --forge-repository when --artifact-target is given,","new_str":"with --yes it exits 1 with `E241` naming each missing flag: --forge-repository when --artifact-target is given,"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01UaLAA7jhoFbqS45xfJrWCN","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/docs/specs/cli.json","old_string":"A workflow is written to .github/workflows/callisto-release.yml only when --workflow is given or the interactive workflow question is answered yes; after writing,","new_str":"A workflow is written to .github/workflows/callisto-release.yml when --workflow is given, the interactive workflow question is answered yes, or, with --yes and no --no-workflow, the origin is a GitHub repository. A workflow nobody asked for that cannot be built (the release tag cannot be resolved, or the file exists) is skipped with a warning and init succeeds. After writing,"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01G9pRq5XvrqQGPrVFYzLUAS","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/docs/specs/cli.json","old_string":"init prints that merging to the default branch publishes and advises requiring pull requests and reviews on it.\"","new_str":"init prints that merging to the default branch publishes, advises requiring pull requests and reviews on it, and lists the next steps: the repository secrets for the detected registries, `callisto add`, `callisto release --dry-run` and the first-publish guide.\""},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01B8AR3evjg4PWyZ2ECseFGx","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/docs/specs/cli.json","old_string":"when a workflow is requested and the file exists, init exits 1 before writing any file.\",","new_str":"when a workflow is requested with --workflow or the interactive question and the file exists, init exits 1 before writing any file.\","},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Mput2Ye3mb7DKvz1LNBpPM","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/README.md","old_string":"callisto init --yes --versioning independent --no-workflow","new_str":"callisto init --yes --no-workflow"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_012dhTKTq8EVxBFRb95ydBqh","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/.changeset/easy-lions-start.md","content":"---\ncallisto-cli: minor\n---\n\n`callisto init --yes` now works with no other flags: packages version independently unless `--versioning fixed` is given, and a GitHub repository gets the release workflow unless `--no-workflow` is given. A single package is no longer asked how to version. If the unrequested workflow cannot be built, such as offline, `init` skips it with a warning instead of failing. After writing the workflow, `init` lists the repository secrets to add and the first commands to run, and the publishing guide has new sections on first publishes and on pulling a release.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_012VtEzA7jRiWRkR6UbhqAP2","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"rm -rf crates/.claude; cargo fmt --all; zsh /tmp/claude-501/ci.sh /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main /tmp/claude-501/ci-init.log; tail -2 /tmp/claude-501/ci-init.log; grep -n \"FAILED\\|panicked\" /tmp/claude-501/ci-init.log | head","description":"Format and run the full CI pipeline","dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true,"timeout":3000000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
