{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","hash":"047f7565c654918ce202d8a1724ff5ad7031a96c2fdb0179ad53dc25c6414ce8","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Dn8FuoXV4JkGsSpfAzajwH","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/crates/callisto-graph/src/aggregate/tests.rs","old_string":"    // The known entry's severity must still be tracked for this run, even\n    // though the changeset itself stays on disk pending the unknown entry.\n    assert_eq!(agg.severities.get(&pkg_bar_id).copied(), Some(Severity::Patch));\n","new_str":"    // The known entry must not bump: the changeset stays on disk, so applying it would bump the package again\n    // on every run until the unknown entry is fixed.\n    assert_eq!(agg.severities.get(&pkg_bar_id).copied(), None);\n    assert!(agg.changelog_inputs.is_empty(), \"{:?}\", agg.changelog_inputs);\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HdmPbUiGvqvsrPkBAZ5Wb5","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/crates/callisto-graph/src/aggregate/tests.rs","old_string":"/// Spec: a changeset with a MIX of a known and an unknown package entry\n/// must NOT be consumed. Consuming it (as the previous code did once\n/// `matched_any` went true) deletes the changeset file while the unknown\n/// entry's bump is never recorded anywhere, silently losing it -- despite\n/// the accompanying diagnostic claiming the changeset \"will not be\n/// consumed until this entry is resolved\".","new_str":"/// Spec: a changeset with a MIX of a known and an unknown package entry\n/// is ignored in full. It is not consumed (that would delete the file and\n/// lose the unknown entry's bump) and it does not bump the known package\n/// either: it stays on disk, so applying it would bump that package again\n/// on every run."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01CKiKrAAt4kQG4djhehqEno","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"grep -n \"fn private_versionless_root_package_json_is_not_a_project\" -B3 -A30 crates/callisto-graph/src/locate/ignore_walk.rs | head -50","description":"Read a discovery test to model the new versionless-crate tests on"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
