{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","hash":"23367ba6d5e2a03306b5a83ac1b8c2b267fdb6e4fa29b928261d0121f3cf9e13","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01LRtGhEgdANGSsj8kEe47Z2","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/docs/specs/versioning.json","old_string":"and a changeset with any such unresolved entry stays on disk unconsumed, even when its other entries resolve.","new_str":"and a changeset with any such unresolved entry stays on disk unconsumed and none of its entries apply (no bump, no changelog line), even when its other entries resolve, until the entry is fixed or removed."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Rvrt3fa7f8X9466bRxyNCQ","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/docs/specs/workspace.json","old_string":"it only holds `workspaces`), regardless of admission.\"","new_str":"it only holds `workspaces`), regardless of admission. A Cargo crate with no `version` (an internal tool such as an xtask) is not discovered as a package and a note names it; a crate that inherits its version with `version.workspace = true` is.\""},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01GgvEvJ8pgNAL3jecpDQ8DN","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/.changeset/steady-pens-wait.md","content":"---\ncallisto-cli: patch\n---\n\nA changeset with an entry that names no package in the workspace, such as a typo or a removed package, now applies none of its entries and says so. Before, its other entries were applied and the file stayed on disk, so every `version` run bumped those packages again. A Cargo crate with no version, such as an xtask, no longer stops every run with E013: it is skipped with a note.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01GzkJ8wZYSvBuBUdtz3opqT","name":"Bash","inpu