{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","hash":"d2bcbbdfa2c72980bad3401c7fb6fa0ae46aa58eeae392e21fe7d82e6c8ecd77","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NCRPRcfnzekLuk1Z5zYisC","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/docs/specs/release.json","old_string":"an unclaimed manifest version changes; or a claimed package is not found.\",","new_str":"an unclaimed manifest version changes; a claimed package is not found; or the commit changes any path other than a manifest (`Cargo.toml`, `package.json`, `pyproject.toml`) or lockfile (`Cargo.lock`, `package-lock.json`, `npm-shrinkwrap.json`, `pnpm-lock.yaml`, `yarn.lock`, `bun.lock`, `bun.lockb`, `uv.lock`, `poetry.lock`, `pdm.lock`) anywhere, a package's changelog, the decision file, a direct-child changeset, or the changesets directory's `pre.json`.\","},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01LoZtWWbm8Gcxcm2UUsW1F2","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/docs/errors.md","old_string":"| E165 | Release commit verification failed | The committed release decision, changelog, or manifest diff does not match what this commit claims to release. Reconcile the commit's contents with its release decision instead of regenerating the intent. |","new_str":"| E165 | Release commit verification failed | The committed release decision, changelog, or manifest diff does not match what this commit claims to release, or the commit changes a path a version commit may not (anything but manifests, lockfiles, changelogs, changesets and the decision file). Reconcile the commit's contents with its release decision instead of regenerating the intent, and move other edits to a separate commit. |"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01BQAifxn6V5dnaSgMzPBhvA","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/docs/publishing.md","old_string":"## Pulling a release","new_str":"## Where a publish goes\n\nA registry with no `url` in `callisto.toml` publishes wherever the checkout's own configuration says: `.npmrc` for npm and `.cargo/config.toml` for Cargo. Callisto honors that on purpose, so a private registry set there keeps working, and it means those files decide where the registry token is sent. Review changes to them like code. A release pull request cannot carry such a change: a version commit may only touch manifests, lockfiles, changelogs, changesets and the decision file, and any other path fails verification with E165. Set `url` on the registry entry to pin the destination in `callisto.toml`.\n\n## Pulling a release"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01A1awzK8T1nuVMN1VLJy3WS","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/.changeset/strict-pines-verify.md","content":"---\ncallisto-cli: minor\n---\n\nA release commit is now checked for what else it changes. Verification (E165) refuses a version commit that touches any path other than manifests, lockfiles, changelogs, changesets, `pre.json` and the decision file, so a release pull request can no longer carry a change to source, a build script, `.npmrc` or `.cargo/config.toml` under the cover of a bot-authored diff. Move such edits to a separate commit.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Wh6LKX61THdemmkTmcc6r9","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"grep -n '\"url\"\\|`url`' docs/config.md | head -3; rm -rf crates/.claude; cargo fmt --all; zsh /tmp/claude-501/ci.sh /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main /tmp/claude-501/ci-allow.log; tail -2 /tmp/claude-501/ci-allow.log; grep -n \" FAILED\\|panicked\\|^error\\|^FAIL\" /tmp/claude-501/ci-allow.log | head -5","description":"Verify the url key exists, then run the full CI","dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true,"timeout":3000000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
