s version is already on the registry under a different repository, so the name belongs to another project | Rename the package. If it is yours (it moved repositories), tag the commit that set this version by hand and run `callisto release` again. |"," | E321 | A `[registries.<name>]` entry for a custom registry has no `kind` | Add `kind = \"cargo\"`, `kind = \"npm\"` or `kind = \"pypi\"`. Only the built-in `cratesIo`, `npm` and `pypi` entries may leave it out. |"," "," "]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"767a61ba-a3c6-4a10-bb48-412ed023d8f6","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"fix/taken-name-first-release","slug":"lexical-jingling-puppy"}
