{"parentUuid":"d5cbfb4d-2b4e-4c9d-a1ab-db25a5d1c4ef","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgMoSdGJFnm516fYDFhD1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01KJgQsTXYmc7qxJdawqdgYm","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/claude-501/ship.sh","content":"#!/bin/zsh\n# usage: ship.sh <branch> <base-branch-or-origin/main> <title> <body-file> <commit-body> <paths...>\ncd /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main || exit 2\nG=/usr/bin/git\nbranch=$1; base=$2; title=$3; bodyfile=$4; cbody=$5; shift 5\n$G fetch -q origin || exit 3\nif [[ \"$($G branch --show-current)\" != \"$branch\" ]]; then\n  $G switch -q -c \"$branch\" --no-track || exit 4\nfi\n$G add \"$@\" || exit 5\n$G status --short | head -20\n$G commit -q -m \"$title\" -m \"$cbody\" || exit 6\n$G push -q origin \"$branch:$branch\" || exit 7\n$G log -1 --format='%h %G? %s'\nprbase=${base#origin/}\nurl=$(gh pr create --base \"$prbase\" --head \"$branch\" --title \"$title\" --body-file \"$bodyfile\") || exit 8\necho \"$url\"\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":725,"cache_read_input_tokens":897261,"output_tokens":1487,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":52},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":725,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1487,"cache_read_input_tokens":897261,"cache_creation_input_tokens":725,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":725},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01KJgQsTXYmc7qxJdawqdgYm":{"file_path":"/tmp/claude-501/ship.sh","content":"#!/bin/zsh\n# usage: ship.sh <branch> <base-branch-or-origin/main> <title> <body-file> <commit-body> <paths...>\ncd /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main || exit 2\nG=/usr/bin/git\nbranch=$1; base=$2; title=$3; bodyfile=$4; cbody=$5; shift 5\n$G fetch -q origin || exit 3\nif [[ \"$($G branch --show-current)\" != \"$branch\" ]]; then\n  $G switch -q -c \"$branch\" --no-track || exit 4\nfi\n$G add \"$@\" || exit 5\n$G status --short | head -20\n$G commit -q -m \"$title\" -m \"$cbody\" || exit 6\n$G push -q origin \"$branch:$branch\" || exit 7\n$G log -1 --format='%h %G? %s'\nprbase=${base#origin/}\nurl=$(gh pr create --base \"$prbase\" --head \"$branch\" --title \"$title\" --body-file \"$bodyfile\") || exit 8\necho \"$url\"\n"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"6392e93a-24fe-4824-b1f5-852b9e26c9ea","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgMoSckY8SrJies3Bn6Bo","requestRef":"42e585de-5ffe-4eab-bb93-12d5ee008d54","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"b4adb32b-8f18-48bf-977d-87a8a3a71151","timestamp":"2026-10-24T21:50:50.955Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"ci/hardening-cheap","slug":"lexical-jingling-puppy"}
{"parentUuid":"b4adb32b-8f18-48bf-977d-87a8a3a71151","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgMoSdGJFnm516fYDFhD1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QsQpy2MSczx5XDPTuoNycA","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/claude-501/body_cheap_ci.md","content":"Three cheap changes that close \"a regression would pass CI\" gaps found in the adversarial review. None changes product behavior, so there is no changeset.\n\n- **Hung jobs and tests are bounded.** Every CI job now has `timeout-minutes: 45`; before, none had one, so a hang held a runner for the 360-minute default. `.config/nextest.toml` kills a single test after eight minutes (120 s periods, four of them) instead of leaving it to the job.\n- **A missing linter fails under `CI`.** The test that lints the generated release workflow with `actionlint` and `zizmor` printed \"not installed; skipping\" when a tool was absent, and the Test job installed neither, so the check never ran in CI. A generated workflow is what every `callisto init` user ships with secrets wired in. The Test job now installs both (`actionlint@1.7.12`, matching the lint job, and `zizmor@1.30.0`), and the test fails when `CI` is set and a tool is missing. Locally it still skips.\n- **`git_batch` has tests.** It parses `git cat-file --batch` output on the release-decision trust path and claims to fail closed on any framing defect, but had no unit tests. Six tests cover order and missing paths, no objects, a failing git, eleven distinct framing defects (no header, wrong object, ambiguous, too few or many fields, non-hex sha, a tree, a non-numeric or oversized size, no separator, trailing output), a size that lands inside a UTF-8 character, and a desynced size. Disabling the separator check makes the framing test fail, so they bite.\n\nNot done: adding pnpm, yarn and bun to the real-tool flag contract needs those tools installed in CI; tracked as a follow-up. `just ci` passes.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":725,"cache_read_input_tokens":897261,"output_tokens":1487,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":52},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":725,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1487,"cache_read_input_tokens":897261,"cache_creation_input_tokens":725,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":725},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01QsQpy2MSczx5XDPTuoNycA":{"file_path":"/tmp/claude-501/body_cheap_ci.md","content":"Three cheap changes that close \"a regression would pass CI\" gaps found in the adversarial review. None changes product behavior, so there is no changeset.\n\n- **Hung jobs and tests are bounded.** Every CI job now has `timeout-minutes: 45`; before, none had one, so a hang held a runner for the 360-minute default. `.config/nextest.toml` kills a single test after eight minutes (120 s periods, four of them) instead of leaving it to the job.\n- **A missing linter fails under `CI`.** The test that lints the generated release workflow with `actionlint` and `zizmor` printed \"not installed; skipping\" when a tool was absent, and the Test job installed neither, so the check never ran in CI. A generated workflow is what every `callisto init` user ships with secrets wired in. The Test job now installs both (`actionlint@1.7.12`, matching the lint job, and `zizmor@1.30.0`), and the test fails when `CI` is set and a tool is missing. Locally it still skips.\n- **`git_batch` has tests.** It parses `git cat-file --batch` output on the release-decision trust path and claims to fail closed on any framing defect, but had no unit tests. Six tests cover order and missing paths, no objects, a failing git, eleven distinct framing defects (no header, wrong object, ambiguous, too few or many fields, non-hex sha, a tree, a non-numeric or oversized size, no separator, trailing output), a size that lands inside a UTF-8 character, and a desynced size. Disabling the separator check makes the framing test fail, so they bite.\n\nNot done: adding pnpm, yarn and bun to the real-tool flag contract needs those tools installed in CI; tracked as a follow-up. `just ci` passes.\n"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"6392e93a-24fe-4824-b1f5-852b9e26c9ea","apiBlockIndex":3,"requestId":"req_011CgMoSckY8SrJies3Bn6Bo","requestRef":"42e585de-5ffe-4eab-bb93-12d5ee008d54","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"2fb33ef2-f334-4123-b3cd-449b6c7c7a26","timestamp":"2026-10-24T21:50:55.712Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"ci/hardening-cheap","slug":"lexical-jingling-puppy"}
