{"type":"file-history-delta","messageId":"2fb33ef2-f334-4123-b3cd-449b6c7c7a26","snapshotMessageId":"4da908e0-74ed-411c-bc90-0d9bae24cc71","trackingPath":"/tmp/claude-501/body_cheap_ci.md","backup":{"backupFileName":null,"version":1,"backupTime":"2026-10-24T21:50:58.041Z","realParentDir":"/private/tmp/claude-501"},"timestamp":"2026-10-24T21:50:58.053Z"}
{"parentUuid":"2fb33ef2-f334-4123-b3cd-449b6c7c7a26","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"bd6ac0ce-389b-4193-aca8-c1bc4969277a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QsQpy2MSczx5XDPTuoNycA","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /tmp/claude-501/body_cheap_ci.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"ca1b9cf2-16b7-4f9d-90ed-cca7a47a06f7","timestamp":"2026-10-24T21:50:58.105Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"create","filePath":"/tmp/claude-501/body_cheap_ci.md","content":"Three cheap changes that close \"a regression would pass CI\" gaps found in the adversarial review. None changes product behavior, so there is no changeset.\n\n- **Hung jobs and tests are bounded.** Every CI job now has `timeout-minutes: 45`; before, none had one, so a hang held a runner for the 360-minute default. `.config/nextest.toml` kills a single test after eight minutes (120 s periods, four of them) instead of leaving it to the job.\n- **A missing linter fails under `CI`.** The test that lints the generated release workflow with `actionlint` and `zizmor` printed \"not installed; skipping\" when a tool was absent, and the Test job installed neither, so the check never ran in CI. A generated workflow is what every `callisto init` user ships with secrets wired in. The Test job now installs both (`actionlint@1.7.12`, matching the lint job, and `zizmor@1.30.0`), and the test fails when `CI` is set and a tool is missing. Locally it still skips.\n- **`git_batch` has tests.** It parses `git cat-file --batch` output on the release-decision trust path and claims to fail closed on any framing defect, but had no unit tests. Six tests cover order and missing paths, no objects, a failing git, eleven distinct framing defects (no header, wrong object, ambiguous, too few or many fields, non-hex sha, a tree, a non-numeric or oversized size, no separator, trailing output), a size that lands inside a UTF-8 character, and a desynced size. Disabling the separator check makes the framing test fail, so they bite.\n\nNot done: adding pnpm, yarn and bun to the real-tool flag contract needs those tools installed in CI; tracked as a follow-up. `just ci` passes.\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"6392e93a-24fe-4824-b1f5-852b9e26c9ea","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","branch":"ci/hardening-cheap","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":3,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":1},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"2fb33ef2-f334-4123-b3cd-449b6c7c7a26","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"ci/hardening-cheap","slug":"lexical-jingling-puppy"}
