{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","hash":"1779b93011bc51c43c2a3f2453eadb4c3fce27b76aa0e97f558eb69d76fc8132","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01DzQeKJKXxhERCNcTawi1RU","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/docs/specs/release.json","old_string":"    {\n      \"id\": \"REL-GH-01\",","new_str":"    {\n      \"id\": \"REL-RERUN-08\",\n      \"criterion\": \"`callisto release` and `callisto release --dry-run` print a warning on stderr for each package's last tag that exists in the repository but not on `origin` (one `git ls-remote` for all of them), saying its release may not have finished. The warning does not change the plan or the exit status, and nothing is printed when there is no `origin`, no tag, or the remote cannot be read.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"REL-GH-01\","},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Mzrpb3d4UQrDYnzAjEsxWz","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/.changeset/quiet-tags-speak.md","content":"---\ncallisto-cli: patch\n---\n\n`release` and `release --dry-run` now warn when a package's last tag exists in your repository but not on `origin`. A release that tagged locally and then failed to push used to be reported as \"Nothing to release.\" on the next commit, with the remote tag and the GitHub release never created.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019fo9moN12bA4cgeaPEerPs","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"rm -rf crates/.claude; cargo fmt --all; zsh /tmp/claude-501/ci.sh /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main /tmp/claude-501/ci-localtag.log; tail -2 /tmp/claude-501/ci-localtag.log; grep -n \" FAILED\\|panicked\\|^error\\|^FAIL\" /tmp/claude-501/ci-localtag.log | head -5","description":"Run the full CI pipeline","dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true,"timeout":3000000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
