{"parentUuid":"4c67bd63-9d40-426d-b4b4-ed14f66d87e9","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"edited_text_file","filename":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/crates/callisto-cli/src/commands/mod.rs","snippet":"32\t    }\n33\t}\n34\t\n35\t/// Escalates workspace graph diagnostics per `strict` (via\n36\t/// `callisto_graph::commands::escalate`) and errors out naming every\n37\t/// diagnostic that is `Error` severity afterward.\n38\t///\n39\t/// Used by `snapshot`, which must abort *before* touching any\n40\t/// files/tags on an error diagnostic -- unlike `status`/`validate`/`version`,\n41\t/// which fold escalated diagnostics into their report and gate on exit code\n42\t/// instead of an `Err`.\n43\tpub(crate) fn abort_on_graph_errors(\n44\t    diagnostics: &[callisto_model::Diagnostic],\n45\t    strict: bool,\n46\t) -> Result<(), crate::error::CliError> {\n47\t    let mut diags = diagnostics.to_vec();\n48\t    callisto_graph::commands::escalate(&mut diags, strict);"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"0d113716-cf7a-4ee5-ade6-e0393bb166bc","timestamp":"2026-10-24T22:03:59.942Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nNote: /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/crates/callisto-cli/src/commands/mod.rs changed on disk since you last read it. That's usually deliberate, so take it as the current state rather than reverting it; if the change looks wrong, say so rather than undoing it yourself — otherwise no need to call it out. Here are the relevant changes (shown with line numbers):\n32\t    }\n33\t}\n34\t\n35\t/// Escalates workspace graph diagnostics per `strict` (via\n36\t/// `callisto_graph::commands::escalate`) and errors out naming every\n37\t/// diagnostic that is `Error` severity afterward.\n38\t///\n39\t/// Used by `snapshot`, which must abort *before* touching any\n40\t/// files/tags on an error diagnostic -- unlike `status`/`validate`/`version`,\n41\t/// which fold escalated diagnostics into their report and gate on exit code\n42\t/// instead of an `Err`.\n43\tpub(crate) fn abort_on_graph_errors(\n44\t    diagnostics: &[callisto_model::Diagnostic],\n45\t    strict: bool,\n46\t) -> Result<(), crate::error::CliError> {\n47\t    let mut diags = diagnostics.to_vec();\n48\t    callisto_graph::commands::escalate(&mut diags, strict);\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lexical-jingling-puppy"}
