{"parentUuid":"06ac7629-e585-4f16-a169-530b2f55286a","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"edited_text_file","filename":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/docs/specs/INDEX.md","snippet":"10\t| [`cli.json`](cli.json) | Command surface, output and exit codes, `status`, `add`, `init`, generated workflows, `pre`, `snapshot`, `completions`, `schema` |\n11\t| [`matrix.json`](matrix.json) | `callisto matrix`: native build targets and runtime constraints for CI |\n12\t\n13\t`REQ-DX-V1.md` is the open v1 requirement; delete it when v1 ships.\n14\t\n15\tHow the code implements these specs: [`ARCHITECTURE.md`](../../ARCHITECTURE.md) and [`docs/architecture/`](../architecture/).\n16\t\n17\tWhen code and a spec disagree, reproduce the behavior first. Fix the spec if the intended contract changed; otherwise fix the code."},"type":"attachment","uuid":"a418e0d1-9e43-4002-9a98-ac58f2ba8082","timestamp":"2026-10-24T22:03:59.945Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nNote: /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/docs/specs/INDEX.md changed on disk since you last read it. That's usually deliberate, so take it as the current state rather than reverting it; if the change looks wrong, say so rather than undoing it yourself — otherwise no need to call it out. Here are the relevant changes (shown with line numbers):\n10\t| [`cli.json`](cli.json) | Command surface, output and exit codes, `status`, `add`, `init`, generated workflows, `pre`, `snapshot`, `completions`, `schema` |\n11\t| [`matrix.json`](matrix.json) | `callisto matrix`: native build targets and runtime constraints for CI |\n12\t\n13\t`REQ-DX-V1.md` is the open v1 requirement; delete it when v1 ships.\n14\t\n15\tHow the code implements these specs: [`ARCHITECTURE.md`](../../ARCHITECTURE.md) and [`docs/architecture/`](../architecture/).\n16\t\n17\tWhen code and a spec disagree, reproduce the behavior first. Fix the spec if the intended contract changed; otherwise fix the code.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","version":"2.1.308","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lexical-jingling-puppy"}
