ll it out. The changes are not shown here; use Read if you need the current content.\n\nNote: /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/crates/callisto-graph/src/changed.rs changed on disk since you last read it. That's usually deliberate, so take it as the current state rather than reverting it; if the change looks wrong, say so rather than undoing it yourself — otherwise no need to call it out. The changes are not shown here; use Read if you need the current content.\n\nNote: /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/crates/callisto-graph/tests/tag_glob_cache_count_test.rs changed on disk since you last read it. That's usually deliberate, so take it as the current state rather than reverting it; if the change looks wrong, say so rather than undoing it yourself — otherwise no need to call it out. The changes are not shown here; use Read if you need the current content.\n\nNote: /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/crates/callisto-graph/src/tags.rs changed on disk since you last read it. That's usually deliberate, so take it as the current state rather than reverting it; if the change looks wrong, say so rather than undoing it yourself — otherwise no need to call it out. The changes are not shown here; use Read if you need the current content.\n\nNote: /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/crates/callisto-model/src/vcs/mod.rs changed on disk since you last read it. That's usually deliberate, so take it as the current state rather than reverting it; if the change looks wrong, say so rather than undoing it yourself — otherwise no need to call it out. The changes are not shown here; use Read if you need the current content.\n\n<total_tokens>14925120 tokens left</total_tokens>\n\nConcise output style is active. Be concise: lead with the result, skip preamble and narration, keep only what the user needs."}]}}
