{"parentUuid":"a110118c-feb7-48d9-9def-6b95766aba10","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgMqDX66oUaRjB51jkZZ4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"PR #358 is open: https://github.com/orin-dx/callisto/pull/358. It reads npm ranges written with spaces, such as `>=1.0.0 <2.0.0` or `1.0.0 - 2.0.0`, as ranges. When a release takes a dependency out of one, `version` now stops with E319 before writing anything.\n\nThe comma-form regression is fixed: `>=1.0.0, <2.0.0` still parses and renders unchanged. I added a unit case for it. The full `just ci` run passed, with line coverage at 92.9%.\n\nThe commit is signed and has no session links or `Claude-Session` trailer, per your standing rule.\n\nI haven't checked the merge state of #353–#357 yet. Next is the rest of the hardening queue.\n\nresult: PR #358 opened to read npm ranges written with spaces (`>=1.0.0 <2.0.0`, `1.0.0 - 2.0.0`), with full CI passing locally."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":452,"cache_read_input_tokens":81173,"output_tokens":318,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":452,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":318,"cache_read_input_tokens":81173,"cache_creation_input_tokens":452,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":452},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"65815801-bbc4-4faa-92d5-5f1b22b8cf47","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgMqDWnyoFzzKTTuPDbeg","requestRef":"13f07eb1-dc67-4bee-88a3-dbe96d5d2f00","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant"